{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioPanelProblems",
  "$description": "The Bottom dock's Problems tab: everything that must be fixed, listed until it is. The adapter hands in one projection per row — its severity glyph, its message, the file it names, the captured log, and, where a recovery command exists, that command's own title and gate — grouped under the source that raised them in first-seen order. Nothing here reads the notification store or the command registry; a row asks the host to open, to run, or to dismiss, by the id it was given.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "panel"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What `.problems-panel`, `.problems-clear`, `.problem-group`, `.problem-group-title`, `.problem-list`, `.problem-row`, `.problem-icon`, `.problem-body`, `.problem-message`, `.problem-path`, `.problem-detail`, `.problem-action` and `.problem-dismiss` said in `styles/panels.css`, keyed on `part` and re-pointed at the studio token layer. Six of those rules are SHARED SELECTORS — `.problems-clear, .activity-clear` and five `.problem-*, .activity-*` pairs — so this document carries its own copy rather than moving one: the `.problem-*` half of each pair is dead the moment this lands, and the stylesheet rule itself can only go when the Activity panel has moved too. Nothing is deleted from `styles/panels.css` here. Three token names could not come with the declarations: `var(--spectrum-font-size-50, 11px)` (the Clear button, the group heading, the path and the log), `var(--spectrum-font-size-75, 12px)` (the row) and `var(--spectrum-corner-radius-75, 2px)` (three rules). Every one of them resolves only inside `<sp-theme>`, and a document mounted in the dock body would have taken the hard-coded fallback every time, so they are the kit's `--jx-text-sm`, `--jx-text-md` and `--jx-radius-xs` instead.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "minHeight": "0",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "& [part=\"body\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& [part=\"actions\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "justifyContent": "flex-end"
    },
    "& [part=\"clear\"] > [part=\"control\"]": {
      "$description": "Bordered but unfilled, and dimmed until it is wanted: emptying the list is the one destructive control on this surface and it sits above rows the reader has not finished reading yet.",
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-3)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-xs)",
      "background": "transparent",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      ":hover": {
        "color": "var(--fg)",
        "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
      }
    },
    "& [part=\"group\"]": {
      "$description": "One source's rows, under its heading. A section rather than a run of rows so the heading and the problems it names cannot be separated by a scroll position.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"group-title\"]": {
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-1)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "textTransform": "uppercase",
      "letterSpacing": "0.04em"
    },
    "& [part=\"list\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "0",
      "listStyle": "none"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "flex-start",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "padding": "6px var(--jx-space-3)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderLeft": "3px solid var(--fg-dim)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "background": "var(--bg-panel)",
      "color": "var(--fg)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"success\"]": {
      "borderLeftColor": "var(--success)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"info\"]": {
      "borderLeftColor": "var(--accent)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"warn\"]": {
      "borderLeftColor": "var(--warning)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"error\"]": {
      "borderLeftColor": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"] > [part=\"icon\"]": {
      "$description": "The severity, twice: as the glyph and as the row's left edge. Colour is never the only encoding here, which is what keeps the row readable in the forced-colours block below, where every author colour is replaced by the user's palette.",
      "flex": "none",
      "width": "14px",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "lineHeight": "1.5"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"success\"] > [part=\"icon\"]": {
      "color": "var(--success)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"info\"] > [part=\"icon\"]": {
      "color": "var(--accent)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"warn\"] > [part=\"icon\"]": {
      "color": "var(--warning)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"][data-severity=\"error\"] > [part=\"icon\"]": {
      "color": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"row-body\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)"
    },
    "& [part=\"message\"]": {
      "overflowWrap": "anywhere"
    },
    "& [part=\"file-path\"]": {
      "$description": "The path is a control, not a label: it opens the file the problem is about, which is the click-through §7.1 asks for. Underlined on hover only — a permanently underlined path in a dense list reads as a paragraph of links. A plain button rather than a `jx-button`, for the reason the status bar's items are: what it has to look like is a line of text, and every fill, border and control height the kit draws would have to be taken back off again. Named `file-path` and not `path` because `jx-icon` puts `part=\"path\"` on the `<path>` of every glyph it draws, so `[part=\"path\"]` inside a row selects this button and both SVG paths beside it — a styling rule that reaches into the kit's own drawing, and a test or a devtools query that cannot tell them apart.",
      "alignSelf": "flex-start",
      "maxWidth": "100%",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "0",
      "border": "none",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-xs)",
      "background": "none",
      "color": "var(--accent)",
      "font": "inherit",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "cursor": "pointer",
      ":hover": {
        "textDecoration": "underline"
      },
      ":focus-visible": {
        "outline": "var(--jx-focus-ring)",
        "outlineOffset": "2px"
      }
    },
    "& [part=\"detail\"]": {
      "$description": "The captured log the progress modal used to own. It scrolls inside the row rather than growing it, so one 400-line `bun install` failure does not become the whole panel.",
      "maxHeight": "180px",
      "margin": "var(--jx-space-1) 0 0",
      "padding": "6px",
      "overflow": "auto",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-xs)",
      "background": "var(--bg)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "whiteSpace": "pre-wrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"action\"]": {
      "flex": "none"
    },
    "& [part=\"action\"] > [part=\"control\"]": {
      "$description": "The recovery button wears the command's own title, so it is read as a verb and not as a decoration: the accent says it acts, and a refused command is dimmed with the reason it names in its tooltip.",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-xs)",
      "background": "transparent",
      "color": "var(--accent)",
      ":hover:not(:disabled)": {
        "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
      },
      ":disabled": {
        "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
      }
    },
    "& [part=\"dismiss\"]": {
      "flex": "none"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The teaching empty state, drawn here rather than borrowed from `panels/empty-state.ts`: that helper is a lit template, and a document cannot call one. What is kept is the pattern's rules (§11) — one sentence saying what the region is FOR, then where its content comes from. It offers no action, because the action that fills this region is a failure and nothing here should invite one.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-6)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "13px"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-message\"], & [part=\"empty-detail\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "maxWidth": "34ch",
      "lineHeight": "1.5"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-detail\"]": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "opacity": "0.8"
    },
    "@(forced-colors: active)": {
      "& [part=\"row\"]": {
        "$description": "The severity bar, redrawn. In forced colours every author colour is replaced by one from the user's palette, so the four left-edge colours collapse into one and the row loses the marker `styles/forced-colors.css` restored for `.problem-row` while this surface was lit.",
        "borderLeft": "2px solid Highlight"
      }
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "body-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/hasProblems"
      },
      "cases": {
        "false": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "empty"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-message"
              },
              "textContent": "Nothing needs fixing."
            },
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-detail"
              },
              "textContent": "Failed writes, validation errors and render failures are listed here until fixed."
            }
          ]
        },
        "true": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "body"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "actions"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-button",
                  "$props": {
                    "size": "sm"
                  },
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "clear"
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/clearAll"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "${state.clearLabel}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "$prototype": "Array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/state/groups"
              },
              "key": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/source"
              },
              "map": {
                "tagName": "section",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "group",
                  "data-source": "${$map.item.source}"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tagName": "h3",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "group-title"
                    },
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.source}"
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "ul",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "list"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "$prototype": "Array",
                        "items": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/rows"
                        },
                        "key": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                        },
                        "map": {
                          "tagName": "li",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "row",
                            "data-severity": "${$map.item.severity}"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "icon",
                                "aria-hidden": "true"
                              },
                              "textContent": "${$map.item.icon}"
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "row-body"
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "tagName": "div",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "message"
                                  },
                                  "textContent": "${$map.item.message}"
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "span",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "file-path-slot",
                                    "role": "none"
                                  },
                                  "style": {
                                    "display": "contents"
                                  },
                                  "$switch": {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/hasPath"
                                  },
                                  "cases": {
                                    "true": {
                                      "tagName": "button",
                                      "attributes": {
                                        "part": "file-path",
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "title": "${$map.item.pathTitle}"
                                      },
                                      "textContent": "${$map.item.path}",
                                      "onclick": {
                                        "$prototype": "Function",
                                        "body": [
                                          {
                                            "operator": "call",
                                            "target": {
                                              "$ref": "#/state/openPath"
                                            },
                                            "value": [
                                              {
                                                "$ref": "$map/item/path"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    }
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "span",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "detail-slot",
                                    "role": "none"
                                  },
                                  "style": {
                                    "display": "contents"
                                  },
                                  "$switch": {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/hasDetail"
                                  },
                                  "cases": {
                                    "true": {
                                      "tagName": "pre",
                                      "attributes": {
                                        "part": "detail"
                                      },
                                      "textContent": "${$map.item.detail}"
                                    }
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "action-slot",
                                "role": "none"
                              },
                              "style": {
                                "display": "contents"
                              },
                              "$switch": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/hasAction"
                              },
                              "cases": {
                                "true": {
                                  "tagName": "jx-button",
                                  "$props": {
                                    "size": "sm",
                                    "disabled": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/actionDisabled"
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "action",
                                    "title": "${$map.item.actionTitle}"
                                  },
                                  "onclick": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/runAction"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "tagName": "span",
                                      "textContent": "${$map.item.actionLabel}"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                              "$props": {
                                "size": "sm",
                                "icon": "x",
                                "hint": "Dismiss",
                                "label": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/dismissLabel"
                                }
                              },
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "dismiss"
                              },
                              "onclick": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/dismissRow"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
